<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Kovia Solutions, LLC</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #1a2a44;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --gold: #c79c4b;
      --light-gray: #f5f5f5;
      --text: #333333;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* Header */
    header { background-color: var(--navy); padding: 1rem 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .logo { color: var(--white); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; }
    nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 1rem; }
    nav a { color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; font-size: 1rem; }
    .btn-outline { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--white); border-radius: 4px; }

    /* Hero */
    .hero { background: url('header-bg.jpg') center/cover no-repeat; color: var(--white); text-align: center; padding: 6rem 2rem; position: relative; }
    .hero::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
    .hero-content { position: relative; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .hero p { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .btn { background-color: var(--gold); color: var(--white); padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold; border: none; border-radius: 4px; }

    /* Sections */
    section { padding: 4rem 2rem; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
    h2 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem; }

    /* Services */
    .services { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2rem; justify-content: space-between; }
    .service { flex: 1; min-width: 200px; text-align: center; }
    .service-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--navy); }
    .service h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

    /* About */
    .about { background-color: var(--light-gray); }

    /* Contact/Fax */
    .contact { background-color: var(--navy); color: var(--white); text-align: center; }
    .contact p { margin: 0.5rem 0; }
    .contact a { color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; }

    /* Footer */
    footer { background-color: var(--navy); color: var(--white); text-align: center; padding: 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .services { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <a href="#" class="logo">Kovia Solutions, LLC</a>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#fax">Fax</a></li>
        <li><a href="#fax" class="btn-outline">Schedule a Consultation</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Management Consulting Services to Drive Your Business Forward</h1>
      <p>At Kovia Solutions, we specialize in delivering strategic insights and tailored solutions to help businesses achieve their goals and excel in a competitive market.</p>
      <a href="#fax" class="btn">Learn More</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="services">
    <h2>Our Services</h2>
    <div class="services">
      <div class="service">
        <div class="service-icon">♞</div>
        <h3>Strategy Development</h3>
        <p>Help businesses define their vision and implement effective strategies.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service">
        <div class="service-icon">⚙️</div>
        <h3>Operational Improvement</h3>
        <p>Streamline processes and enhance operational efficiency.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service">
        <div class="service-icon">👥</div>
        <h3>Organizational Change</h3>
        <p>Guiding transformations for sustainable success.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about" id="about">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>Kovia Solutions is a premier management consulting firm committed to delivering exceptional value through deep industry knowledge and a client-centric approach. We partner with organizations of all sizes to navigate challenges and seize opportunities.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="contact" id="fax">
    <h2>Contact & Fax</h2>
    <p>4780 I-55 N, Ste 100, Jackson, MS 39211</p>
    <p>Phone: (601) 873-8745 | Fax: (601) 873-8746</p>
    <p>Mon–Fri: 8:30 a.m.–5:30 p.m. | Sat–Sun: Closed</p>
    <p><a href="mailto:koviasolutions@koviasolutions.com">koviasolutions@koviasolutions.com</a></p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 Kovia Solutions, LLC. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
 
</html>
